WEBVTT

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:32.056
Wacha niseme tu, kwa uzito kabisa,

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:33.720
ninakuamini.

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:36.760
Na licha ya kila kitu,

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:41.560
bado ninaamini Marekani.

00:19:43.760 --> 00:19:47.296
Ninatumaini kua hii sadaka
niliyowapa usiku wa leo,

00:19:47.320 --> 00:19:49.856
niliyowashirikisha usiku wa leo,

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:53.656
italeta njia za ukombozi

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:58.256
ili uweze kudai
utambulisho wako kikamilifu

00:19:58.280 --> 00:20:01.096
na kua mshiriki mkubwa